<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Muhaha!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I feel it!\rThe sparkle in your eyes!\nThe sparkle of FRIENDSHIP!\rYou somethin’ else.\nYour {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} a real one!\rIt’s ready for the\nPokéathlon, bud!\rMost of all, your bond and trust\nwith your homies make me\fbelieve in INFINITE potential!\rAight. Follow me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you think?\nThis the Pokéathlon Dome!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokéathlon is a sports festival\nfor Hustlers and homies!\rInside the Dome is all kinds of\nchallenges waitin’ on Hustlers and\fhomies to test their bond.\fWhy don’t you try it?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You amazin’, bud!\nWhat a nice surprise!\rSeein’ a Pokéathlete with big\npotential is a blessin’! I’m glad\fI brought the Pokéathlon to Johto.\r...My name Magnus.\nWe’ll meet again, bud.\rMagnus: Later, young Pokéathlete!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I feel it!\rThe sparkle in your eyes!\nThe sparkle of FRIENDSHIP!\rYou ready for the\nPokéathlon, bud!\rMost of all, your trust and\nteamwork with your homies make me\fbelieve ANYTHING is possible!\rAight. Follow me, bud!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmmm...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Runnin’ and jumpin’ and...\nThere’s SO many events for homies\fto pick from. Which one I’mma try?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ODDISH: Odd! Odd!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s more to homies than scrappin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MEOWTH: Nyaah!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It ain’t good at scraps...but no\nhomie can outrun it, thanks\fto our mornin’ walk every day!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huff huff!\nTrainin’ every day is the sure way\fto glory!\rDashin’ 1,000 times!\nThat’s my goal right now.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s your goal?\nHavin’ a goal make life hit different.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">............\nOh, you done the dash 1,000 times?\rI thought that was impossible,\nbut you make me feel brave.\rGood looks!\nHere, take this!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m your fan now! I’d run\nanywhere for you!\fI got your back!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">PIDGEY: Po po!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You heard of Aprijuice?\rHomies can boost their Performance\nwith food and drinks.\rAprijuice is a drink made from\nnutrition research to boost\fPerformance.\rIf your homie drink it before\na Pokéathlon event, it show its\ftrue potential! Pre-workout, fr.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWBRO: Whick!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Every homie got its own vibe.\rA true Pokéathlete know ’em and let\nthe true Performance of their\fhomies shine!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MACHOP: Machao!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh!\nThey lookin’ good today!\rThey wasn’t feelin’ it yesterday,\nbut we winnin’ today for sure!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWPOKE: Moah!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">FARFETCH’D: Teree!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">PSYDUCK: Guack!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Energy drink!\nWelcome to the Aprijuice stand!\rYou givin’ your homies Aprijuice?\nI can explain whatever you\fneed to know! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Energy drink!\nWelcome to the Aprijuice stand!\rHuh? Why you look so confused?\nYou don’t know about Aprijuice?\fHere, take this!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Apriblender!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You put the Apriblender\nin the Apricorn Box.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">With the Apriblender, you can\nmake Aprijuice so your homies show\ftheir true potential!\rIt’s SO easy to make! All you\ngotta do is put Apricorns in the\fApriblender. Stuff it full!\rThe more, the better!\nThen you walk!\rYou can run if you want...\n98...99...100 steps!\rThere! Then open it, give it to your\nhomie, or drink it yourself.\rYou can buy Aprijuice here too.\nWhy don’t you try it out?\rAny more questions? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aprijuice boost a homie’s\nPerformance! Homies got strengths\fand weaknesses.\rBut don’t trip. Give it\nAprijuice, and you can max out its\fPerformance!\rYou gon’ need it!\rAny more questions? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pick from the three Apriblenders.\rThe labels tell you what kinda drink\nit is. Different drinks got\fdifferent effects.\rUse ’em to fit the event\nyou wanna enter. That’s how you\fbecome a top Pokéathlete.\rBut remember this!\nIf your homie’s Performance is maxed\fout, you can’t go no higher.\rCheck your homie’s\nPerformance before you\fgive it Aprijuice.\rAny more questions? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Charge up with friendship!\nGet in the know about Aprijuice!\fPick one off the shelf!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good taste!\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}!\fOnly ${STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0}! That’s a steal! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks!\nWhich homie you givin’ it to?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Charge up with friendship!\nCome back when you want more!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s a shame!\nCome back when you wanna win!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you ain’t got enough bread!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}!\nOnly ${STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0}! That’s a steal! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! What can I do for you?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Its richness is {STRVAR_1 52, 3, 0}!\nIts smoothness is {STRVAR_1 52, 4, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Owner’s Comment\nSomebody, somewhere made this!\fThe mysterious {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}!\rIt might go up.\nIt might go down.\fMay luck be with this juice!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Owner’s Comment\nNot many people know about it!\rIt’s the rookie Pokéathlete\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}!\rIt’s a long way from perfect!\nBut some people can’t resist it!\fIt’s a gleam of {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Owner’s Comment\nYou know who be around here!\rThis {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0} is what made\nyou-know-who who they\fare today!\fTry it if you feelin’ sluggish!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Owner’s Comment\nYou don’t know it?\fThat’s the last thing you wanna hear!\rIt’s time you try {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s\n{STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}, the sign of a new era!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Owner’s Comment\n{STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0} was made by\fthat famous Pokéathlete!\rYou might never shake their hand,\nbut you can drink the same juice!\rThis a must-cop juice for every\nPokéathlete!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Owner’s Comment\n{STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}!\fMade by that elite Pokéathlete!\rYou might never see it again.\nIf you ain’t winnin’ today, when?\rFor those who wanna win today, here\ngo the juice of victory!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Owner’s Comment\n{STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0} of the legendary\fPokéathlete!\rIt grew up right next to {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rThe road to victory show up when you\ndrink it! This make you a legend!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It boost your homie’s\nPerformance!\rLet it shine with Aprijuice!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0137_D49_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokéathlon Dome\nThe Place for True Pokéathletes!</language>
	</row>
</body>
